                                                "sense_id": "0af8382d-98b3-3cef-a068-e074eb5dbadd",
                                                "text": "There is a snaky gleam in her hard grey eye, as of anticipated rounds of buttered toast, relays of hot chops, worryings and quellings of young children, sharp snappings at poor Berry, and all the other delights of her Ogress's castle."
